                     <title>Psalterium glo.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">The litany includes Thomas Becket, canonized in
                        1173. B71.20 shows that 'Roger' was the donor of this book to the abbey,
                        Roger Sigar (d. 1191) being the likeliest candidate. See further M. Gullick,
                        'Reflections and observations on Romanesque manuscripts and charters from
                        Reading abbey', Reading Medieval Studies 42 (2016) 1--24, at 10--11.</note>
